EN:
I can't wait for the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I've been really nice to all the fish in
preparation for today.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Since I'm their friend now,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm sure
they'll let me catch them,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
¡A ver si empieza el Torneo de
Pesca!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}He intentado ser majo con
todos los peces para caerles bien.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Dado que ahora somos amigos,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡espero que me dejen pescarlos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} için sabırsızlanıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugüne hazırlanırken bütün balıklara
çok iyi davrandım.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Artık arkadaş sayılırız,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} kesin beni
görünce yakalanmaya razı olurlar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Isn't it time{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} for the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
yet?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}My heart has been going a mile a 
minute ever since I woke up,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Todavía no ha empezado{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
el Torneo de Pesca?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Llevo con el corazón en un
puño desde que me levanté,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}has started!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
You're going down today,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Il torneo di pesca è iniziato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Non sperare di battermi,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Acabo de tener una gran idea!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Cuando acabe el Torneo de Pesca,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡hagamos una fritanga de pescado!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ho appena avuto un'idea mitica!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dopo il torneo di pesca, dobbiamo
organizzare una bella grigliata!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡Nadie quiere a los peces
más que yo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Ven, pececillo, pececillo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
¡No te comeré, te lo prometo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Once the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}is over,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm gonna eat a whole bunch of
{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}} to treat myself!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Subito dopo il torneo di pesca,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mi mangerò un bel piatto
di {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}!

EN:
Since the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Fishing Tourney{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'s almost
over,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}let's give it everything we got,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
On est dans la dernière ligne droite,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}c'est le moment de donner tout ce
qu'on a, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
Il torneo di pesca sta per finire,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}dobbiamo dare il tutto per tutto
ora,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bald ist das Turnier vorbei!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Komm, wir strengen uns noch
mal richtig an,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Balık Turnuvası{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} neredeyse bittiğine
göre,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}sonuna kadar basalım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I wonder what place my fish got?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I can't stand the anticipation!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I need to know now,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Chissà come mi sarò classificato...!?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Quest'attesa mi snerva!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Caspitina,
ditemi i risultati,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Auf welchen Platz ich mit meinen
Fischen wohl gekommen bin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oh, diese Spannung,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Acaba balığım kaçıncı oldu?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bu meraka dayanamıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hemen bilmem lazım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Diesmal hast du beim {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
echt gut abgeschnitten, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Und ich bin dir gar nicht böse.
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Schließlich hab ich selbst auch
einige leckere Fischlein gefangen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Parece que esta vez he ganado
yo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Pero por poco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Tampoco es que quiera fardar,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡pero creo que atraigo a los peces
de forma natural!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Hättest du gedacht, dass ich dich
beim {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Angelturnier {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}schlagen kann?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hatte einfach einen guten Tag!
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Aber jetzt bin ich ganz schön fertig.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich glaub, ich mach erst mal ein
Nickerchen...

IT:
La cerimonia di premiazione è finita.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mi spiace che te la sia persa,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La prossima volta sarai {{TAG:000E:0006:0C0069006C0020006D0069006F000C006C00610020006D0069006100}}
ospite d'onore!

EN:
You know the awards ceremony
already happened, don't you?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Let's go together next time,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} If I nab a big fish,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm
gonna rub it in everyone's faces,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

